# Public build-time defaults — no secrets belong in this file (see .gitignore: only the
# bare `.env` is tracked; `.env.local` etc. stay ignored for anything that isn't public).
#
# Used by src/lib/site.ts to build absolute og:image / og:url values. Overridden per-build
# in .github/workflows/pages.yml so a fork of this template resolves to its own Pages URL
# instead of hardcoding christian93kg's.
PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN=https://christian93kg.github.io
